<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21226" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βύρσα</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>skin stripped off, hide</i>
			(prop. <i>ox-hide</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. καὶ ἄλλα δέρματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.110
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Batr.
				127
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				531a11
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βύρσης ὄζειν</span> smell
				<i>of leather</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				892
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βύρσης κτύπος</span>
			<i>of the drum</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				513
			</span></i>; <i>wineskin</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Lex.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				<u>Or.</u>
				26(14).18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>skin</i> of a live animal, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				25.238
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in contempt,
			of the human <i>skin</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κακὴ β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.
					3.80
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>screen</i> or perh. <i>sail</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nav.</u>
				4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
